  <!-- *Migration Note: classic ASP.NET (System.Web-based) projects have no official SDK-style
       support, so this stays a legacy-style Web Application project, matching every other web
       project in SampleProjects. packages.config is gone, every package is a <PackageReference>
       instead. Unlike Samples.MvcWebApi, this project's original had NO logging/error-handling
       infrastructure at all (no log4net, no filters beyond the stock HandleErrorAttribute), so
       no Serilog/DatabankException conversion was needed here, there was nothing to convert.
       Two real bugs were found and fixed, see LectureNotes.md: LocationLookupController never
       disposed its DbContext (a real resource leak), and Views/Home/Index.cshtml loaded a
       second, different-version copy of jQuery from CDN on top of the site's own bundled one. -->
